        "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>Apologies if this has been asked before.</p>\n<p>I’m a little late to the party but I’ve recently bought the CRB and looking to get my friends into it, but I don’t know if there is a specific PDF for the character creation section I can share with them.</p>\n<p>I know Christopher had previously said they like to provide PDFs to people who have purchased the physical book (and I’m happy to email a proof of purchase) but understand if that is not necessarily the policy now.</p>",
